Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第11集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:46.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.90,0:27:22.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（星期三）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.85,0:29:21.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六个月后）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.39,0:37:33.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（星期三）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 我们一起去杀些凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say we kill some evil sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹点麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we raise a little hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拿自己的灵魂换吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're offering up your own soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要复活萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is bring Sam back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给了你多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long they give you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}One year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你将变成的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is what you're gonna become.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想办法救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find a way to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,1835年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in 1835,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨穆埃尔·柯尔特造了把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel Colt made a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这枪能杀任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gun can kill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真名叫贝拉·塔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela Talbot's her real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.81,0:00:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty frigging far from a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉偷了柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela stole the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.32,0:00:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.99,0:00:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮什么 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help with what? - With Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要帮我为他做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to help me get him ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自扛起战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fight this war on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床啦 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 亚洲乐队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. Asia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 你喜欢这歌 你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You love the song, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.63,0:00:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.25,0:01:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让我再听一遍 我一定自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if I ever hear it again, I'm gonna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 抱歉 听不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I'm sorry. I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等你了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever you're ready, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想去吃早餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who's ready for some breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全驾驶哦 皮克特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive safely now, Mr. Pickett.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,上菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不点单就不能待在这里 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stay unless you order something, Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.70,0:02:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.99,0:02:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,周二 瞎买猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuesday. Pig in a poke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You even know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.87,0:02:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们准备好点单了吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you boys ready? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要特色菜 来点培根 还有咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the special, side of bacon and coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要咖啡 还有松饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it two coffees and a short stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.21,0:02:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 萨姆 这案子不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, Sam, this job is small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该去找贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be spending our time hunting down Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.97,0:02:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我们这就去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sure, let's get right on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪来着 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she again? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我跟你一样想找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, believe me, I wanna find her as bad as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我们有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, we have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.02,0:02:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这个教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so this professor…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴克斯特·哈索贝克 上周经过了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dexter Hasselback, he was passing through town last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后已知地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last known location?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他女儿说 他当时正要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}His daughter says he was on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,布劳沃德郡的神秘地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}to visit the Broward County Mystery Spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「物理规则失去意义的地方」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where the laws of physics have no meaning"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,两杯黑咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two coffees. Black…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有辣酱 蘸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some hot sauce for the…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:02:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你知道这种地方就是骗游客的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you know joints like this are only tourist traps, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么球滚上坡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know, balls rolling uphill,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,家具钉在天花板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}furniture nailed to the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唯一危险的也就是你的钱包 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The only danger is to your wallet. - Okay. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是说 这世上有些地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, there are spots in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.77,0:03:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有裂开的洞口 吞噬人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}where holes open up, and swallow people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,百慕大三角 俄勒冈州旋涡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bermuda Triangle, the Oregon Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,布劳沃德郡神秘地点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broward County Mystery Spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.23,0:03:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时 这种地方是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sometimes these places are legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果是真的 这还很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So if it is legit, and that's a bigass "if."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那相关传说是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the lore?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说其实都很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lore's freaking nuts, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说 这种地方的电磁场很强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say these places, the magnetic fields are so strong…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以能扭曲时间空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they can bend space-time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把受害人送去…不知哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}sending victims… no one knows where.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:40.46,Title,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我觉得听上去太《X档案》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sounds a little X-Files to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说塞不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it wouldn't fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你想要个普利策新闻奖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, a Pulitzer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不是说这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Look, I'm not saying this is really happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果是 我们该去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it is, we gotta check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we can do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚等关门后过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go tonight after they close,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好慢慢地看看那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}get ourselves a nice, long look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,离奇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你要找什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.85,0:04:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要抢劫我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You robbing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 没人要抢劫 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, nobody's robbing you. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.67,0:05:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Don't move. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just putting the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是有意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I didn't mean to…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.93,0:05:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:05:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床啦 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 亚洲乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 你喜欢这歌 你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You love this song and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I think I…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我做了个怪梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I had a weird dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 小丑还是侏儒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Clowns or midgets?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全驾驶哦 皮克特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive safely now, Mr. Pickett.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不点单就不能待在这里 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stay unless you order something, Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,周二 瞎买猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuesday. Pig in a poke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是周二吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Tuesday?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们准备好点单了吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you boys ready? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要特色菜 来点培根 还有咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the special, side of bacon and a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.06,0:07:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing for me. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改主意就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know if you change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.44,0:07:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 萨姆 这案子不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, Sam, this job is small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该去找贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be spending our time hunting down Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.27,0:07:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的感觉还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you feel okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't…?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得这一切了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 像是已经发生过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today. Like… Like it's happened before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指似曾相识感吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, like deja vu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 像是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, like it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是真的发生过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it's really happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 就是似曾相识嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Like deja vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别去想似曾相识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Forget about deja vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是问你 你是否觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you if it feels like,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又重过了一遍昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}like we're living yesterday all over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 这怎么不叫似曾… - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, how is that not deja…? - Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑咖啡 还有辣酱 蘸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee, black. And some hot sauce for the…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应挺快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I'm sorry but.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 昨天是周二 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look. Yesterday was Tuesday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.43,0:08:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天还是周二\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today is Tuesday too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好吧 你绝对没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No. Good. You're totally balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是说 这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just saying that it's crazy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.15,0:08:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便对我们来说也太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, even-for-us crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:09:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,澳洲野犬吃了我的孩子那么疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dingo-ate-my-baby crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这又是你的灵力预知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was another one of your psychic premonitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不会 太逼真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way. Way too vivid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 我们去了神秘地点 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look. We were at the Mystery Spot, and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就醒过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说塞不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it wouldn't fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你想要个普利策新闻奖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, a Pulitzer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 神秘地点 你说会不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. The Mystery Spot. You think maybe it…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去那里看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta check that place out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就信我一把 好吗 - 好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, just go with me on this, okay? - All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚等关门后过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go tonight, after close,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好慢慢地看看那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}get ourselves a nice long look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.02,0:09:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就去吧 马上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go now. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正在营业 人多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Business hours. Nice and crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你真怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, you're a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.65,0:09:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床啦 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,周二 瞎买猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuesday. Pig in a poke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说 好吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Would you listen to me, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都要抓狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I am flipping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们准备好点单了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you boys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要特色菜 来点培根 还有黑咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll take the special, side of bacon, coffee black.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing for me. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你那么霸道时 我都有点麻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I get all tingly when you take control like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit screwing around, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… So…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你陷入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you think that you're in some kind of a.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么… - 时间循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what exactly…? - Time loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.68,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 像《土拨鼠之日》 - 对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like Groundhog Day. - Yes. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:54.81,Title,0,0,0,0,,就像《土拨鼠之日》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Groundhog Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.35,0:10:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有点疯狂 即便对我们来说也太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little crazy. I mean, even-for-us crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,澳洲野犬吃了我的孩子那么疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dingo-ate-my-baby crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.98,0:11:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我要那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know I was gonna say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你已经说过一次了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you've said it before, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想跟你说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my whole point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑咖啡 还有辣酱 蘸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee, black. And some hot sauce for the…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.74,0:11:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.21,0:11:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反应挺快啊 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice reflexes. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是有某种解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure that there's some sort of an explanation…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.97,0:11:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就信我一把吧 好吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna have to go with me on this. All right, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须信我 这是你欠我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to. You owe me that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静 - 别叫我冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down… - Don't tell me to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.97,0:11:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, because…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.27,0:11:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你今天会死 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you die today, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会死 今天不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna die. Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经两次了 我眼看你死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice now, I've watched you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再来一次了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't do it again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:12:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能相信我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.42,0:12:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是觉得你疯了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think you're nuts, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不管怎么回事 我们一起查清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Whatever this is, we'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.85,0:12:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说塞不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it wouldn't fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.56,0:12:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你想要个普利策新闻奖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, a Pulitzer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这个烂俗的骗游客的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think this cheesy-ass tourist trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟此事有关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}has something to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里可能是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's the real deal, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,电磁场扭曲了时间空间还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magnetic fields bending space-time, or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:30.65,Title,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我觉得这似乎太《X档案》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. All seems a little too X-Files for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.65,0:12:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道还要怎么解释 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know how else to explain it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚等关门后过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go tonight, after they close,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好慢慢地看看那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}get ourselves a nice, long look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no. We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死在了那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I die there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被打爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blown away, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们现在去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给老子让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did he…?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.86,0:13:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.99,0:13:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去像电影里那么酷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it look cool like in the movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失禁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You peed yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.29,0:13:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I peed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,被车撞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man gets hit by a car,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还指望他能完全控制自己的膀胱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think he has full control over his bladder?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 你们不知道我有多感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, I can't tell you how much I appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.47,0:13:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非常需要好报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use all the good ink we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.18,0:13:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经营这里多久了 卡皮亚克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you owned the place, Mr. Carpiak?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家族守护这里的秘密有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my family's been guarding the secrets here since…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想知道有多久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't wanna know when.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果发生了什么怪事 你肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'd know if anything strange happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.65,0:13:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里经常发生怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange happens here all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个神秘地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mystery spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那究竟什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:14:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「物理规则失去意义的地方」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It's where the laws of physics have no meaning."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.62,0:14:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 具体呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Like how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,参观一圈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个失踪的人 戴克斯特·哈索贝克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy who went missing, Dexter Hasselback,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.59,0:14:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也参观了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}he take the tour?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.09,0:14:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么样的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of article is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.18,0:14:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方已搜索了这里的每一寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police scoured every inch of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找不到那人 我也没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They couldn't find that man. I never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是个家族生意 - 听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're a family establishment. - Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有古怪的事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something weird going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底知不知道内情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do you know anything about it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.65,0:14:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年3月在法院拍卖上买的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a foreclosure auction last March, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前是卖保释保证书的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I used to sell bail bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大侦探 我们去喘口气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Kojak. Let's get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:14:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hate to say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:15:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那地方跟我想的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that place is exactly what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是鬼扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那究竟怎么回事 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so what is it then, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.14,0:15:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底撞上什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is happening to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let me just…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.31,0:15:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我每天都会死 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So every day, I die. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时你便又会醒来 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when you wake up again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.69,0:15:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就确保我不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's just make sure I don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能活到明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I make it to tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时间循环或许就会中止\N{\fnArial\fs30}then maybe the loop stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也能查清真相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can figure all this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们买点外卖 回旅馆去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we grab some takeout, head back to the motel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不做 直到午夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}lay low until midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想吃中餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants Chinese?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床啦 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是觉得你疯了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think you're nuts, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么回事 我们一起查清\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever this is, we'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.59,0:16:23.64,Title,0,0,0,0,,如果你卡在《土拨鼠之日》里了 为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're stuck in Groundhog Day, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么在搞鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's behind it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,起初我以为是神秘地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, first I thought it was the Mystery Spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我不太确定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们努力保住你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep you breathing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量撑到明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}try to make it to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我唯一能想到的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only thing I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不会太难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't be too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.69,0:16:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我已经看着你死了几次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I've watched you die a few times now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.24,0:16:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我似乎就是无法阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't ever seem to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么是板上钉钉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nothing's set in stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我每天都点一样的东西 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say I order the same thing every day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 瞎买猪和培根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Pig in a poke, side of bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以把培根换成香肠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get sausage instead of bacon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.67,0:16:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 这就不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Different day already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.59,0:17:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你和我决定了我不要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause see, if you and I decide that I am not gonna die…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我们都不能去吃早餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, we can't even go out for breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了周三你会感谢我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll thank me when it's Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.47,0:17:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这炸玉米饼味道有没有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do these tacos taste funny to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.61,0:18:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都好 没人会受伤的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's fine. Nobody's gonna get hurt, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不你放下斧子 放了这人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should drop the ax and let this guy go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.41,0:18:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里肯定有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's gotta be going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要查个明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to find out what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.75,0:18:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方已经被拆得差不多了 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place is tore up pretty good, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 消停下来吧 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time to give it a rest. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它全拆掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take it down to studs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 够了 把斧子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, that's enough. Give me the ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别管了 迪恩 - 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave it, Dean. - Give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Let… Let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 迪恩 放开 - 行了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Dean. Leave it. - Come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.73,0:18:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全驾驶哦 皮克特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive safely now, Mr. Pickett.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.02,0:18:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,上菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.90,0:18:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不点单就不能待在这里 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stay unless you order something, Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,周二 瞎买猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuesday. Pig in a poke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:18:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 你不希望他开车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. You don't want him behind the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们准备好点单了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要特色菜 来点培根 还有咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the special, a side of bacon and coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,多莉丝 我想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doris. What I'd like is for you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,去射箭馆多练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}log in some more hours at the archery range.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你箭术太差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a terrible shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的 - 猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know that? - Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 所以你觉得你陷入了什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you think you're caught in some kinda what again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:32.57,Title,0,0,0,0,,就像《土拨鼠之日》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Groundhog Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓 根本无法阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter. There's no way to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你脾气好坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez. Aren't you grumpy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是的 知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I am. You wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我连续经历的第一百个周二了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becuase this is the hundredth Tuesday in a row I've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直就没停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it never stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.67,0:19:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是的 我脾气有点坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}So yeah, I'm a little grumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,辣酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.47,0:19:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 黑咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Coffee, black.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有辣酱 蘸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some hot sauce for the…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反应挺快啊 - 我知道这会发生 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice reflexes. - I knew it was gonna happen, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道要发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know everything that's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.19,0:20:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不会知道一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.78,0:20:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你会读心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, you're a mind reader.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.91,0:20:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut it out, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得自己很逗 但其实只是很幼稚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're being funny, but you're being really childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特化妆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester wears makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特做爱时会哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester cries his way through sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.67,0:20:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特在床边放了把尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester keeps a ruler by the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.09,0:20:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天早上 他醒来时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every morning, when he wakes up…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.59,0:20:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,收银员兰迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randy, the cashier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在从收银机里揩油\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's skimming from the register.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈耶斯法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judge Meyers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他晚上会穿一身毛绒兔子装\N{\fnArial\fs30}At night, he puts on a furry bunny outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.23,0:20:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回家的路上会打劫机械师托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna rob Tony the mechanic on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.36,0:20:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 我度过了一切可能的周二\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point is I've lived through every possible Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着你以各种方式死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've watched you die every possible way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:20:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把神秘地点大卸八块 烧为平地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have ripped apart the Mystery Spot, burnt it down,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.91,0:21:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,试遍了能想到的所有办法救你 但我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}tried everything I know to save your life and I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.91,0:21:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我怎么做 你都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what I do, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是周二了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it's Tuesday again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有办法摆脱这循环的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be some way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我该死的钥匙呢」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where's my dang keys?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该死的钥匙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my dang keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不好意思」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Excuse me."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还挺漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走过这条街那么多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the times we've walked down this street,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did I ever do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.65,0:21:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百个周二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundred Tuesdays,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.37,0:21:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都没看过一次她手里拿了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never bother to check what she was holding in her hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是那个失踪者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This the guy who went missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 那是他女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - That's his daughter back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.97,0:21:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.27,0:22:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.35,0:22:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要个朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody need a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方报告称 戴克斯特·哈索贝克是个教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the police report says Dexter Hasselback is a professor…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.07,0:22:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他还做别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's not all he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问过他女儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.70,0:22:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个大记者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy's quite the journalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在杂志上写专栏 还写博客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Columns in magazines, a blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.21,0:22:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他写旅游景点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He writes about tourist attractions:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘地点 不明飞行物坠毁地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mystery spots, UFO crash sites.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以揭穿骗局为乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets his kicks debunking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.88,0:22:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经让四个这种地方关门歇业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's already put four of these places out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.30,0:22:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.89,0:22:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「戴克斯特·哈索贝克：真相战士」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dexter Hassleback: Truth warrior"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.89,0:22:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说就是自大的笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a pompous schmuck, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.93,0:22:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.98,0:22:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读了他写的所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've read everything the guy's ever written.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.31,0:22:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那么自以为是 肯定重有千斤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've weighed a ton, he was so full of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.27,0:22:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪来的时间做这么多调研\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you have time to do all this research?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.07,0:23:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 就是…挺好笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Just… It's funny, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.87,0:23:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this guy spends his whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.12,0:23:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在贬低神秘地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}crapping on mystery spots and…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.99,0:23:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他消失在了一个里\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he vanishes in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.37,0:23:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺诗意的 有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kinda poetic, you know, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.62,0:23:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}just deserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. It is just deserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.45,0:23:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一百个周二吃的都是枫树糖浆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy has maple syrup for the past hundred Tuesdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.64,0:23:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在突然改吃草莓味儿的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden, he's having strawberry?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.60,0:23:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由国家嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a free country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.36,0:23:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不能自己选糖浆口味了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man can't choose his own syrup?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.75,0:23:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们变成了什么样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we become?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.07,0:23:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这家餐馆里不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in this diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.15,0:23:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这一天里不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.74,0:23:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方的一切从来不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing in this place ever changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.20,0:23:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,从不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.95,0:23:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.96,0:23:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床啦 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.60,0:24:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你觉得你陷入了什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think you're caught in some kinda what again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.98,0:24:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃你的早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat your breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.24,0:24:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,包里是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in the bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.17,0:24:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者该说 你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or should I say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.84,0:24:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 求你别杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God. Please, don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.17,0:24:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我用了很长时间 但我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me a hell of a long time, but I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 是你的手法暴露了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's your M.O. that gave you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.85,0:24:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,针对自大混蛋 让他们罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going after pompous jerks, giving them their just deserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.68,0:24:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就喜欢那个 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kind loves that, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好吧 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.48,0:24:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把木桩放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put the stake down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.60,0:24:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 或许你该… - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, maybe you should… - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.61,0:24:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.23,0:24:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有能力做到你做的这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}powerful enough to do what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.03,0:25:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭空捏造现实 把人塞进时间循环里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making reality out of nothing, sticking people in time loops.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.15,0:25:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你差不多得是个神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, you'd pretty much have to be a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.86,0:25:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得是个恶作剧精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have to be a trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.41,0:25:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我叫爱德·科曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister, my name is Ed Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.33,0:25:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子叫艾米莉娅 我有两个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife's name's Amelia. I got two kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.95,0:25:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷啊 我是卖广告位的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For crying out loud, I sell ad space.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.41,0:25:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别骗我 我知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lie to me! I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.83,0:25:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀过一个你的同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've killed one of your kind before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.34,0:25:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 伙计 你没杀过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, bucko, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.31,0:25:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.90,0:25:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩蠢蛋上次企图杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chuckleheads tried to kill me last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.32,0:25:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干吗不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.15,0:25:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有哈索贝克 他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Hasselback. What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.65,0:25:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That putz?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.82,0:25:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他不相信虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he didn't believe in wormholes,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.24,0:25:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把他丢进了一个虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I dropped him in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.12,0:25:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you guys showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.37,0:25:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一来 我就发现你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made you the second you hit town.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.67,0:25:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你来说很好玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is fun for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.88,0:26:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一遍遍杀死迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Dean over and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.80,0:26:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 是的 是好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, yes, it is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.55,0:26:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.22,0:26:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才不是为了杀迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is so not about killing Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.56,0:26:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩笑是针对你的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This joke is on you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.52,0:26:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天眼看着你哥哥死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching your brother die every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.65,0:26:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.07,0:26:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.65,0:26:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要多久才能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will it take you to realize…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.82,0:26:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救不了你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't save your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.58,0:26:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.76,0:26:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.58,0:26:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了你 一切就马上结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kill you, this all ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.88,0:26:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.29,0:26:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是玩玩罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just playing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.96,0:26:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开不起玩笑 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't take a joke? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.88,0:26:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以解脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.13,0:26:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天 你醒来 就是周三了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, you wake up, it'll be Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.26,0:26:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.51,0:26:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.97,0:26:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是 你知道去哪找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I am, you know where to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.72,0:26:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在餐馆吃松饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having pancakes at the diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.56,0:27:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 还是杀了你更简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Easier to just kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.82,0:27:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.98,0:27:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.66,0:27:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算睡一天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you gonna sleep all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.12,0:27:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有亚洲乐队 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No Asia. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.71,0:27:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这电台真烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This station sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.50,0:27:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是周三\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 一般都是紧接着周二的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, which usually comes after Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.84,0:27:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那玩意关了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn that thing off, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.26,0:27:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.47,0:27:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难道不是你听过的最美妙的歌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the most beautiful song you've ever heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.43,0:27:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.76,0:27:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你过了多少个周二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez. How many Tuesdays did you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.14,0:27:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我数不过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I lost count.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.94,0:27:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.19,0:27:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你昨天很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you were pretty wacked out of it yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.86,0:27:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我记得我们碰到了恶作剧精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I remember running into the trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.65,0:27:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但再就没别的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no, that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.15,0:27:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.90,0:27:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾东西 我们马上离开这里 现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack your stuff. Let's get the hell out of town. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.16,0:27:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吃早餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.49,0:27:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.13,0:28:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们就这么放过恶作剧精灵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure we should just let the trickster go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.88,0:28:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的钱包给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.43,0:28:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy. Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.01,0:28:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺放松的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.47,0:28:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.47,0:28:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人希望事情往坏的方向发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wants this to end the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.72,0:28:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about it a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.28,0:28:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.16,0:28:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 今天不该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Not today. Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.46,0:28:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不该发生这种事了 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't supposed to happen today. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.18,0:28:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该醒过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.95,0:29:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆 给我留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam. Leave me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.29,0:29:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it's Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.46,0:29:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你在死亡谷干掉的那个恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard about that demon thing you took care of in Death Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.50,0:29:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.42,0:29:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们都三个月没联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been about three months we talked, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想听到你的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be nice to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.14,0:29:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我打电话 我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give a call. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.80,0:30:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 还是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Bobby again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.30,0:30:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.39,0:30:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你没一个人坐在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me you're not sitting alone somewhere…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.72,0:30:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,执迷于找恶作剧精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}obsessing over this damn trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.02,0:30:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给我 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.35,0:30:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以一起找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can find it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.23,0:30:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人该独自面对那样的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one man should take something like this on alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.11,0:30:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.03,0:30:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 奥斯丁那个吸血鬼血巢 真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, that vampire nest in Austin, hell of a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.88,0:30:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? It's Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.59,0:30:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.36,0:31:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.87,0:31:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么来这里 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing here, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.16,0:31:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们能确定的最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is the last place we're sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.54,0:31:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶作剧精灵曾施展魔法的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}the trickster worked his magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.50,0:31:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.54,0:31:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你想抓到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.46,0:31:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到个召唤仪式 能把恶作剧精灵引来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a summoning ritual to bring the trickster here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.30,0:31:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.42,0:31:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.92,0:31:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少血\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.18,0:31:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式需要近一加仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ritual says near a gallon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.05,0:31:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且要新鲜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's gotta be fresh too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.67,0:31:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我们得流干一个人的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning we have to bleed a person dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.02,0:31:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且必须是今晚 否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's gotta be tonight, or.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.35,0:31:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要再等50年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not for another 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.19,0:31:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们去找血吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's go get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.41,0:32:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真让我心碎 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break my heart, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.08,0:32:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.33,0:32:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会允许你杀个无辜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you murder an innocent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.37,0:32:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么带我来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.33,0:32:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.67,0:32:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是唯一能让你来见我的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it was the only way you'd see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.84,0:32:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想让你恢复理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm trying to knock some sense into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.30,0:32:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我以为你不会考虑杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I thought you'd back down from killing a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.34,0:32:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you thought wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.14,0:32:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下东西 我自己做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the stuff. I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.93,0:32:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我不会允许你杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I'm not gonna let you kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.85,0:32:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做什么与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's none of your damn business what I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.48,0:32:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是那么想要回你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want your brother back so bad…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.54,0:32:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.00,0:32:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.37,0:32:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀我 总比杀个平民好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better me than a civilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.42,0:33:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了 鲍比 我才不会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy, Bobby. I'm not killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.59,0:33:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还成我疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm the crazy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.37,0:33:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.64,0:33:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老了 我的人生快结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm old. I'm coming near the end of my trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.56,0:33:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还能继续战斗 救人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can keep fighting, saving folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.15,0:33:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你需要你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you need your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.69,0:33:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以让我帮你救回他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me give him back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.78,0:33:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.78,0:33:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Dean, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.37,0:33:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是我最接近家人的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys are the closest thing I have to family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.62,0:33:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.84,0:33:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.30,0:33:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.61,0:34:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,利索点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.32,0:34:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.45,0:34:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.29,0:34:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.21,0:34:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're not Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.60,0:34:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.35,0:34:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.40,0:34:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.95,0:34:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.20,0:34:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是骗你玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just screwing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.16,0:34:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真不错啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good, though, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.00,0:34:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.92,0:34:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.71,0:35:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说迪恩是心理有问题的那个兄弟的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever said Dean was the dysfunctional one…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.00,0:35:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没见过你手里拿着尖利物体的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}has never seen you with a sharp object in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.42,0:35:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是全金属外壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Full Metal Jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.97,0:35:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,复活他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.76,0:35:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.56,0:35:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的姑娘没送花给你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't my girl send you the flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.56,0:35:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.85,0:35:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.81,0:35:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵魂这会儿正在楼下跳地狱烈火伦巴呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}His soul's downstairs doing the hellfire rumba as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.65,0:35:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我们回到那个周二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take us back to that Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.49,0:35:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者周三 一切开始的时候 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Wednesday, when it all started, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.53,0:35:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会来找你的 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't come after you. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.16,0:35:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You swear?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.12,0:35:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.21,0:35:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I could…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.21,0:35:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能 - 不假\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can. - True.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.54,0:35:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不代表我该那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that don't mean I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.60,0:35:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.51,0:35:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a lesson here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.72,0:35:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直努力想灌输进\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've been trying to drill into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.80,0:35:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那颗怪异的克鲁马努人的脑袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}freakish, Cro-Magnon skull of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.68,0:35:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.01,0:35:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}What lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.14,0:35:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对拯救迪恩的执迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This obsession to save Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.73,0:36:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩不断地为彼此牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you two keep sacrificing yourselves for each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.02,0:36:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会有好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing good comes out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.78,0:36:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有鲜血和痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just blood and pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.99,0:36:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩是你的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.03,0:36:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad guys know it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.46,0:36:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会害死你的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be the death of you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.92,0:36:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时 你得对人放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you just gotta let people go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.72,0:36:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.01,0:36:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.22,0:36:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like it or not…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.01,0:36:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是失去他之后的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is what life's gonna be like without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.35,0:36:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.39,0:36:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.11,0:36:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.44,0:36:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 简直像对牛弹琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, it's like talking to a brick wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.32,0:36:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.79,0:37:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切几个月前就不再好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This all stopped being fun months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.71,0:37:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直是穿短裙的出租车司机 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Travis Bickle in a skirt, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.00,0:37:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.42,0:37:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.50,0:37:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning, that's for me to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.80,0:37:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己琢磨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.52,0:37:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算睡一天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you gonna sleep all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.23,0:37:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 没有亚洲乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. No Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.77,0:37:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这电台真烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This station sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.86,0:37:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是周三\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.41,0:37:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 一般都是紧接着周二的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Which usually follows Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.33,0:37:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那玩意关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn that thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.34,0:37:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你过了多少个周二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, how many Tuesdays did you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.38,0:37:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.18,0:37:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.97,0:37:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.77,0:38:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你昨天很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you were pretty wacked out yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.73,0:38:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得抓到恶作剧精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember catching up with the trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.19,0:38:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再就没别的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.15,0:38:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.44,0:38:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吃早餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.49,0:38:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.45,0:38:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去收拾车\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll pack the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.82,0:38:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你别想一个人去任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You're not going anywhere alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.74,0:38:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是停车场而已 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the parking lot, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.37,0:38:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.66,0:38:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.09,0:38:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去不太好 还发生什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look so good. Something else happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.18,0:38:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是做了个很怪的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a really weird dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.14,0:38:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小丑还是侏儒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clowns or midgets?
